            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قصاب گوشت را چرخ کرد. Qassâb gusht râ charkh kard. The butcher minced the meat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Gusht-e charkh karde is minced meat. Charkh \"wheel\", for the mincer."
            }
          ]
        },
